OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F409A1785865789
OL,3,CPolice attend large hay bale fire at
OL,4,CWiltshire beauty spot
OL,6,FEmergency crews are tackling are fire
OL,7,Finvolving 250 hay bales near a popular
OL,8,Fbeauty spot in Wiltshire.
OL,10,FDorset and Wiltshire Fire and Rescue
OL,11,FService were called to reports of a
OL,12,Ffire affecting hay bales on Hackpen
OL,13,FHill at around 9.32am this morning (1
OL,14,FAugust).
OL,16,FThe hill is one of eight in the county
OL,17,Fthat has a white horse figure on it.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/3
