OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F409A1785865789
OL,3,CPolice attend large hay bale fire at
OL,4,CWiltshire beauty spot
OL,6,FFire crews from Westlea, Swindon and
OL,7,FMarlborough stations have been in
OL,8,Fattendance, and Wiltshire Police has
OL,9,Falso been requested to attend the
OL,10,Fscene.
OL,12,FEmergency teams have been using hose
OL,13,Freels to extinguish the fire and farm
OL,14,Fmachinery to create a fire break and
OL,15,Fprevent fire spread.
OL,17,FWalkers and cyclists are being urged
OL,18,Fto avoid the area while emergency
OL,19,Fcrews deal with the incident.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/3
